title ZARIX — Integraciones: PAT, bandeja, MCP y REST v1

package "Vercel (Next.js 15.5.28)" {
    component "PWA\nPendientes / Integraciones" as Front
    component "REST v1\n/api/v1/tools" as Rest
    component "MCP\n/api/mcp" as Mcp
    component "Wallet ingest\n/api/ingest/wallet" as Wallet
    component "Registro de\nherramientas" as Reg
    component "Bandeja pendiente\n(pending-inbox)" as Inbox
    component "PAT\n(zrxp_ hash SHA-256)" as Pat
}

package "Supabase" {
    database "PostgreSQL + RLS" as Db
    component "Vault\ntelegram / gemini" as Vault
    component "Auth JWT" as Auth
}

cloud "Canales" {
    component "Cliente MCP / REST" as Cli
    component "Wallet del\ndispositivo" as Dev
    component "Bot Telegram" as Bot
}

Cli --> Mcp : Bearer PAT
Cli --> Rest : Bearer PAT
Dev --> Wallet : PAT ingest
Mcp --> Pat : valida
Rest --> Pat : valida
Wallet --> Pat : valida
Mcp --> Reg : execute
Rest --> Reg : execute
Reg --> Inbox : park sin confirm
Wallet --> Inbox : reserva / auto-confirm
Inbox --> Db : claim RPC
Pat --> Db : token_hash
Bot --> Vault : lee token
Vault --> Db : secret_id
Front --> Inbox : confirma / descarta
Front --> Pat : emite / revoca
Reg --> Auth : alcance de usuario

legend right
Proyecto: ZARIX — TIF UAI 2026
Autor: Jeffrey Dietz
Metodología: ICONIX
Fuente: Ingeniería del código real (PRs #16, #17 y #25)
Las escrituras remotas se estacionan; el ledger
sólo cambia tras claim o confirm=true.
endlegend

